### Lookup addresses by postcode
GET http://localhost:8080/address-lookup-api/addresses?postcode=AB124NY

### Lookup multiple legacy addresses by postcode
GET http://localhost:8080/address-lookup-api/multiple-addresses?postcode=NE119NU

### Lookup multiple legacy addresses by postcode (ISL table)
GET http://localhost:8080/address-lookup-api/multiple-addresses?postcode=BT100BU

### Lookup single legacy address by postcode
GET http://localhost:8080/address-lookup-api/postcode?postcode=NE119NU

### Lookup multiple addresses by postcode using Postcode API
GET https://postcode.cidev.aws.chdev.org/multiple-addresses/AB124NY

### Lookup multiple legacy addresses by postcode
### ALS-121 Fix returning empty for premises whereas within the postcode lookup api it returns the complete premise name
GET http://localhost:8080/address-lookup-api/multiple-addresses?postcode=LU49PJ

# Ordnance Survey API

###
# @name [OS] query the detailed dataPackageId
GET https://api.os.uk/downloads/v1/dataPackages/24833/versions/150450
key: {{os_api_key}}

###
# @name [OS] show all data package available
GET https://api.os.uk/downloads/v1/dataPackages
key: {{os_api_key}}

###
# @name [OS] query the new data package with using dataPackageId
GET https://api.os.uk/downloads/v1/dataPackages/24833
key: {{os_api_key}}